    "Expressive typography: inflated, warped, handwritten type as the event",
    "Warm eclecticism: mixed eras, warm wood, lived-in warmth",
    "Neo-folk craft: one specific folk tradition, credited",
    "Sensory 3D materials: soft inflated chrome and glass",
    "Quiet organic minimalism: natural materials, negative space, earth tones"
  ],
  "scenes": [
