      "step": "Setup",
      "text": "Why mix them? Each model has its own design instincts. So you get more varied directions, you see which model designs best for your site, and you spread the work across accounts you already pay for. Add --blind, and you won't see who made each one until you've kept it.",
      "actions": [
        {
