      "step": "Review and go",
      "text": "A few words about your site, and what must stay: here, the prices, the sign-up button and the FAQ. Then the review. I designed this screen to show exactly what will run, and what it costs. Variantly is free and open source; each variant is one session on your own plan, plus one for its review. Ten variants, twenty sessions. Trying it out? Start with four.",
